---
import Site from '../components/Site.astro';
import ProjectCards from '../components/ProjectCards.astro';
---
<Site title="Scornis | Student Innovation, AI, Robotics & Emerging Technology" description="Discover Scornis, a student-led innovation team exploring aerospace robotics, artificial intelligence, marketing technology, education, food safety, and emerging healthcare technologies.">
<div class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">SCORNIS / Student-led. Future-focused.</p><h1>Ideas Beyond<br/>Boundaries.<br/><span class="accent">Innovation<br/>Without Limits.</span></h1><p>Scornis is a student-led innovation and technology organization exploring bold solutions across aerospace robotics, artificial intelligence, education, food safety, marketing technology, and emerging healthcare systems.</p><div class="buttons"><a class="button primary" href="/innovations">Explore Our Innovations ↗</a><a class="button" href="/contact">Collaborate With Us</a></div></div><div class="orbital"><svg viewBox="0 0 500 500" fill="none" role="img" aria-label="Abstract orbital paths and connected scientific geometry, a conceptual illustration rather than deployed technology"><defs><radialGradient id="sphere"><stop stop-color="var(--accent-color)" stop-opacity=".3"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--brand-dark)" stop-opacity=".05"/></radialGradient><linearGradient id="orbit"><stop stop-color="var(--primary)"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--primary)" stop-opacity=".1"/></linearGradient></defs><g opacity=".18" stroke="currentColor">{[90,130,180,220].map(r=><circle cx="250" cy="250" r={r}/>)}<path d="M20 250H480M250 20V480M85 85l330 330M85 415 415 85"/></g><circle cx="250" cy="250" r="104" fill="url(#sphere)" stroke="url(#orbit)"/><g stroke="url(#orbit)"><ellipse cx="250" cy="250" rx="215" ry="70" transform="rotate(-35 250 250)"/><ellipse cx="250" cy="250" rx="200" ry="100" transform="rotate(40 250 250)"/><ellipse cx="250" cy="250" rx="105" ry="35"/><ellipse cx="250" cy="250" rx="35" ry="105"/></g><g fill="var(--primary)"><circle cx="84" cy="346" r="6"/><circle cx="409" cy="349" r="5"/><circle cx="334" cy="141" r="4"/></g><g stroke="var(--accent-color)" stroke-width="2"><path d="m205 277 45-91 46 91-46-28Z"/><path d="m203 212-30-20-28 32 30 20ZM299 284l30 22 29-34-30-20Z"/><path d="m180 214 20 14m102 44 20 15"/></g><g stroke="currentColor" opacity=".5"><path d="M351 149h55v-33M95 353H44v35M340 347h90"/></g><g fill="var(--accent-color)" font-size="8" letter-spacing="2"><text x="358" y="107">CONNECTED IDEAS</text><text x="30" y="408">RESEARCH / DESIGN</text></g></svg><span class="visual-label">CONCEPTUAL VISUAL / CONCEPTUAL ORBITAL GEOMETRY</span></div></section><div class="ribbon"><span>Aerospace & Robotics</span><span>AI & Digital Solutions</span><span>Health & Emerging Technologies</span></div>
<section class="section split"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Our mission</p><h2>We Build for Problems That Matter.</h2></div><div><p>We believe meaningful innovation begins with asking better questions. At Scornis, we explore challenging problems, research possible solutions, develop concepts, test ideas through simulations and experiments, and work toward practical technologies.</p><a class="accent small" href="/about">Discover Scornis ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / The innovation portfolio</p><h2>Six ideas.<br/>New possibilities.</h2></div><p>Engineering Ideas Into Tomorrow’s Possibilities. Explore our concepts, their research questions, and the work still ahead.</p></div><ProjectCards/></section>
<section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">03 / How we think</p><h2>Our innovation process</h2><div class="process">{['IDENTIFY','RESEARCH','DESIGN','SIMULATE & TEST','LEARN','IMPROVE'].map((s,i)=><span>{s}{i<5?' →':''}</span>)}</div><p class="small">This represents our intended development approach rather than completed milestones for every project. We investigate problems, study evidence, define concepts, test assumptions, and use what we learn to improve.</p></section>
<section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">04 / Why Scornis?</p><h2>Curiosity with a clear purpose.</h2><div class="grid four">{[['Multidisciplinary Thinking','Different disciplines help us approach complex challenges from new angles.'],['Research-Driven Innovation','We investigate evidence and limitations before advancing a concept.'],['Human-Centered Problem Solving','We consider the people, needs, and contexts behind the technology.'],['Continuous Experimentation','We test assumptions, document learning, and refine our direction.']].map(([title,text],i)=><article class="feature"><span class="number">0{i+1} /</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</div><div class="buttons"><a class="button" href="/team">Meet Our Team ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="cta"><p class="eyebrow">The next possibility starts with a conversation.</p><h2>Have a Challenge Worth Solving?</h2><p>We welcome conversations with engineers, researchers, mentors, universities, incubators, and organizations interested in exploring meaningful technological solutions.</p><div class="buttons"><a class="button primary" href="/innovations">Explore Projects ↗</a><a class="button" href="/contact">Contact Scornis</a></div></section></div>
</Site>